        <field name="html_content" type="html"><div class="oe-course-content"><p><span class="oe-path">My Day</span> is a start screen for the day: today's meetings, to-dos, tasks and tickets, money owed to you and money due, and quotes waiting on customers, each with a link to the full list.</p><div class="oe-diagram"><img src="/business_elearning/static/img/my_day.png" alt="My Day with today's schedule, tickets, tasks due and money" class="img-fluid" /><p class="oe-diagram-caption"><span class="oe-diagram-caption-tag">Screenshot</span>a print shop's My Day: a proof review, a ticket, a task due tomorrow and $1,830 overdue.</p></div><p>To open it every time you log in, tick <strong>Start on My Day</strong> in your <span class="oe-path">Preferences</span> (your picture, top right). Everything on it is yours: other people see their own day.</p><div class="oe-callout"><span class="oe-callout-icon"><i class="fa fa-lightbulb-o" /></span><div><span class="oe-callout-label">Work from the top</span><p>Plan with the left column (schedule and to-dos), then clear the right column (what needs attention) between meetings.</p></div></div></div></field>
