    <record id="channel_work" model="slide.channel">
        <field name="name">Projects, Helpdesk and Your Website</field>
        <field name="channel_type">training</field>
        <field name="description" type="html"><p>Projects that include outside people, customer questions as tickets, and a website that sends you leads.</p></field>
        <field name="visibility">members</field>
        <field name="enroll">invite</field>
        <field name="is_published" eval="True" />
        <field name="enroll_group_ids" eval="[(6, 0, [ref('base.group_user')])]" />
    </record>
    <record id="channel_work_s1" model="slide.slide">
        <field name="channel_id" ref="channel_work" />
        <field name="is_published" eval="True" />
        <field name="name">Projects and tickets</field>
        <field name="is_category" eval="True" />
        <field name="sequence">10</field>
    </record>
    <record id="channel_work_s1_l1" model="slide.slide">
        <field name="channel_id" ref="channel_work" />
        <field name="is_published" eval="True" />
        <field name="name">Tasks for outside contacts</field>
        <field name="slide_category">article</field>
        <field name="sequence">11</field>
        <field name="html_content" type="html"><div class="oe-course-content"><p>A task can belong to someone outside the company: a freelancer, or the customer themselves. Set <strong>Assigned Contact</strong> on the task, alongside or instead of staff assignees.</p><div class="oe-diagram"><img src="/business_elearning/static/img/task_contact.png" alt="A task assigned to a freelance designer" class="img-fluid" /><p class="oe-diagram-caption"><span class="oe-diagram-caption-tag">Screenshot</span>Final artwork, assigned to a freelance designer.</p></div><p>The contact becomes a follower, so messages you send from the task's chatter reach them by email, and their email replies land back on the task.</p></div></field>
    </record>
    <record id="channel_work_s1_l2" model="slide.slide">
        <field name="channel_id" ref="channel_work" />
        <field name="is_published" eval="True" />
        <field name="name">Helpdesk tickets</field>
        <field name="slide_category">article</field>
        <field name="sequence">12</field>
        <field name="html_content" type="html"><div class="oe-course-content"><p><span class="oe-path">Helpdesk › Tickets › All Tickets</span> lists customers' questions and problems, each with a number, who has it and its stage.</p><div class="oe-diagram"><img src="/business_elearning/static/img/helpdesk.png" alt="Two helpdesk tickets" class="img-fluid" /><p class="oe-diagram-caption"><span class="oe-diagram-caption-tag">Screenshot</span>two tickets: faded banners and a reprint question.</p></div><p>Customers open tickets by email (each team's <strong>Email Alias</strong> in <span class="oe-path">Helpdesk › Configuration › Teams</span>) or from their account on your website. Reply from the ticket's chatter; your reply is emailed to them and the conversation stays on the ticket.</p></div></field>
    </record>
    <record id="channel_work_s2" model="slide.slide">
        <field name="channel_id" ref="channel_work" />
        <field name="is_published" eval="True" />
        <field name="name">Your website and your system</field>
        <field name="is_category" eval="True" />
        <field name="sequence">22</field>
    </record>
    <record id="channel_work_s2_l1" model="slide.slide">
        <field name="channel_id" ref="channel_work" />
        <field name="is_published" eval="True" />
        <field name="name">Your website</field>
        <field name="slide_category">article</field>
        <field name="sequence">23</field>
        <field name="html_content" type="html"><div class="oe-course-content"><p><span class="oe-path">Website</span> opens your site with an <strong>Edit</strong> button: click any text to change it, and drag blocks in from the left. Its <strong>Contact us</strong> form sends leads to CRM.</p><p>Newsletter sign-ups go to <span class="oe-path">Email Marketing › Mailing Lists</span>. Choose a <strong>Welcome Email</strong> on a list and everyone who signs up gets it once.</p></div></field>
    </record>
    <record id="channel_work_s2_l2" model="slide.slide">
        <field name="channel_id" ref="channel_work" />
        <field name="is_published" eval="True" />
        <field name="name">Looking after your system</field>
        <field name="slide_category">article</field>
        <field name="sequence">24</field>
        <field name="html_content" type="html"><div class="oe-course-content"><p><span class="oe-path">Security › Login Attempts</span> shows failed logins; addresses that keep guessing passwords are blocked for good, listed in <span class="oe-path">Security › IP Rules</span>.</p><p>An administrator can put the apps in order and group them into folders in <span class="oe-path">Settings › Users &amp; Companies › App Drawer</span>.</p><div class="oe-callout"><span class="oe-callout-icon"><i class="fa fa-life-ring" /></span><div><span class="oe-callout-label">Need a hand?</span><p>Your hosting includes support: ask us before changing settings you're unsure about.</p></div></div></div></field>
    </record>
